      ],
      "message": "depends: fetch qrencode from GitHub under a new file name\n\nThe qrencode tarball is no longer on fukuchi.org, which now points to\nGitHub for downloads. The old URL returns 404, so every build takes\nthe file from the fallback at bitcoincore.org.\n\nTake the GitHub tag archive instead. Its hash differs from the old\ntarball, so store it as qrencode-4.1.1-v2.tar.gz. The old file name\nkeeps its old hash on the fallback and in the CI caches, so the\nrelease branches are not affected. This is the follow-up to #33577.",
